cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "php2shell — Pre-auth RCE & reverse shell PoC for CVE-2026-109618 / CVE-2026-109619"
message: "If you use this PoC in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Whackermelon"
    alias: "Whackermelon"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Whackermelon/Php2Shell-POC"
url: "https://github.com/Whackermelon/Php2Shell-POC"
abstract: >-
  Proof-of-concept exploit demonstrating unauthenticated remote code
  execution against PHP core through the session upload-progress handler
  (CVE-2026-109618 OOM corruption chained with CVE-2026-109619 stale
  global state). Takes a single URL and yields a reverse shell.
keywords:
  - CVE-2026-109618
